{
 "id": "jerusalem",
 "note": "Claude draft for Jerusalem: the lost walls (City of David, Hezekiah, First, Second and Third Walls, Byzantine, Fatimid/Crusader) and the Ottoman wall that OpenStreetMap gives only as a point, built-up extents from the City of David to the 1890s, Temple Mount and Holy Sepulchre phases, gates by period, the Roman street grid and name/kind changes. The courses of the Second and Third Walls are disputed (the Third Wall is drawn on the line of the present north wall, not the Sukenik-Mayer line). Note: the Haram gates in the plan share the Southern Wall wikidata id (Q2912191) and its date -19, so they cannot be renamed here.",
